{{!--
Vignette of a post: the picture its CARDS show (tiles, posters, rows, leads, the ••• panel, saved lists).
Ghost has no separate thumbnail field, so the theme uses the image the author set for SOCIAL SHARING
when there is one, and the feature image (the banner of the article header) otherwise:
  1. og_image       Post settings > Facebook card > image (Ghost Admin)
  2. twitter_image  Post settings > X card > image
  3. feature_image  the post's feature image
  4. nothing        the caller's designed no-image state (placeholder="tile" | "row")
An image set for sharing that differs from the feature image is marked data-vignette="social": it is
usually a composed picture with its own text, so posters show it whole (backdrop=true) and the page
transitions do not morph it into the article header (which keeps the feature image). Every vignette is
served as WebP (image/srcset.hbs: Ghost converts it on the first request; social cards are often large PNGs).
The article header and the home hero keep the feature image: they are not cards.
Inside a post context. Parameters (named so, as a partial's parameters reach the partials it calls):
  imgClass="..."          class of the <img>
  widths="small" | "medium" | "large"   srcset widths (image/srcset.hbs)
  srcSize="s" | "m" | "l" fallback src size
  sizes="..."             sizes attribute (defaultSizes="..." when sizes is empty)
  eager=true              fetchpriority="high" (above the fold); priority="auto": no loading hint;
                          default loading="lazy"
  backdrop=true           posters: a social vignette is shown whole over a blurred backdrop (the
                          feature image when there is one, else the vignette itself)
  placeholder="tile"      no image: the tinted tile carrying the title; "row": the compact row's empty
                          thumbnail; omitted: nothing
--}}
{{~#if og_image~}}
  {{~#match og_image feature_image~}}
    {{> "vignette/img" vignetteSrc=feature_image vignetteSocial=false}}
  {{~else~}}
    {{> "vignette/img" vignetteSrc=og_image vignetteSocial=true}}
  {{~/match~}}
{{~else if twitter_image~}}
  {{~#match twitter_image feature_image~}}
    {{> "vignette/img" vignetteSrc=feature_image vignetteSocial=false}}
  {{~else~}}
    {{> "vignette/img" vignetteSrc=twitter_image vignetteSocial=true}}
  {{~/match~}}
{{~else if feature_image~}}
  {{> "vignette/img" vignetteSrc=feature_image vignetteSocial=false}}
{{~else~}}
  {{~#match placeholder "tile"~}}
    <span class="tile__placeholder" aria-hidden="true"><span>{{title}}</span></span>
  {{~else match placeholder "row"~}}
    <span class="row-item__placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  {{~/match~}}
{{~/if~}}
